      en: ["A 40-hectare botanical garden located just southeast of Toliara.", "Founded in 1980 by Swiss amateur botanist Herman Petignat.", "Contains over 900 plant species, 90% of which are endemic to the southwest.", "Dedicated to preserving the bizarre, highly adapted flora of the 'spiny forest'.", "Many plants were rescued from areas threatened by regional charcoal production.", "Serves as a critical botanical gene bank and educational research center."]
